# Results land here. Only a real model run is tracked.
#
# run_eval.py writes one file per run, named from the kind of run, the provider,
# the split and a UTC timestamp:
#
#     consent-<kind>-<provider>-<split>-%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ.json
#
# where <kind> is "eval" or "sweep" and <provider> is "openai" or "stub".
#
# A stub run stays untracked on purpose. It measures the harness, not a model,
# and a file in the repository that reads like a score nobody can trace to a
# model is worse than no file.
*
!.gitignore
!consent-*-openai-*-????????T??????Z.json
